# Locales (lt, en, et, lv, ja)

- **Canonical:** `en/index.html`, `js/library.js` → then `npm run generate:et-lv`
- **Manual:** `lt/`, `ja/`, all privacy pages (`lt/privatumas.html`, `*/privacy.html`)
- **Do not** hand-edit `et/` or `lv/` for EN parity — use the generator
- CI: no uncommitted diff in `et/index.html`, `lv/index.html`, `js/library.{et,lv,lt}.js`

